  "instructions": [
    "Preheat binchotan grill to 400°f. ",
    "Soak the basmati rice in water for at least 30 min. ",
    "Sous-vide beetroot at 180°f for 1 hour and 30 min. ",
    "Toast the pumpkin seeds on the binchotan grill for 5 min. ",
    "Heat coconut oil in a pan and sauté the onion and ginger for 5 min. ",
    "Add fenugreek leaves, salt and lemon juice to the pan and stir for 1 min. ",
    "Combine cooked basmati rice, beetroot, and toasted pumpkin seeds in a mixing bowl. ",
    "Fluff the mixture with a fork and serve hot."
  ],
